    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get to know us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/97453f4ea251ae793f6300d6d7947c98.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d0f3e6210df74e5baa5d58507577a6d7.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d0f3e6210df74e5baa5d58507577a6d7.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d0f3e6210df74e5baa5d58507577a6d7.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/c67aead20f3093a84f644b92c1d5f132.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaparks is a highly immersive and unique theme park simulator where players design, share, and explore the theme parks of their dreams. Combining the expansive nature of MMOs with the open-ended creativity of sandbox games, Metaparks allows players to design intricate attractions, architecture, and scenery with a powerful, intuitive modular building system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simulation layer challenges players to manage resources, balance guest satisfaction, and compete within a thriving economy. With user-generated content (UGC) at its core, players can create, share, and explore their unique creations in a vibrant, community-driven experience.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/8f83142773c87d3bc7dda23cf1b2214f.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/8f83142773c87d3bc7dda23cf1b2214f.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/8f83142773c87d3bc7dda23cf1b2214f.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme parks are defined by the worlds they create\u2014their power lies in the stories they tell. In Metaparks, every in-game theme is rooted in a richly developed universe, complete with original IPs, immersive lore, character backstories, and cross-media storytelling. From environmental design to NPC interactions, every element contributes to a living, breathing world built for exploration and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/287e99943034b7fc743958009e417dd4.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d3733423583277962c59778a0d0fc789.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d3733423583277962c59778a0d0fc789.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d3733423583277962c59778a0d0fc789.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've drawn inspiration from iconic creators in the themed entertainment world. Metaparks is grounded in the principles of real-world ride systems, physically-based materials, special effects, and park design\u2014reimagined for players. By simplifying complexity without sacrificing depth, we offer the components and knowledge to build impressively realistic parks in a playful, intuitive way. From pre-made schematics to modular systems teaching through practice, we empower players to think like designers\u2014while still having fun like guests <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/b0103ef51af6960582afea7616f18a01.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/225c22d62df3bd0cd91ed3f526d4f811.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/225c22d62df3bd0cd91ed3f526d4f811.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/225c22d62df3bd0cd91ed3f526d4f811.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Metaparks is launching with a range of captivating biomes and imaginative themes, each combining to create truly unique park experiences.\u00a0Every biome influences gameplay uniquely\u2014shaping weather patterns, foliage, lighting, and available attractions, and wardrobe items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/06d5faf7b282566539c1f2721ece7694.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/06d5faf7b282566539c1f2721ece7694.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/06d5faf7b282566539c1f2721ece7694.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/b3ecc40164f045bb003b67c870b21f0c.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/7e5851c15e6a5658d4465e4fd35b7a79.avif?t=1750436025\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Metaparks, every creator has the opportunity to establish a Virtual Brand\u2014a personal or shared identity spanning parks, players, and playstyles. Your Virtual Brand grows with you, expanding to new locations, sharing profits, and attracting contributors who add value to your vision. Whether you're working solo or collaborating with friends, your Virtual Brand unlocks new ways to grow, delegate tasks, and scale across the Metaparks universe. <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/30d4a3ef7667af396d56efa376bfd015.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/963c73b2ba39abd0ec24a747ebf6a0a7.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/963c73b2ba39abd0ec24a747ebf6a0a7.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/963c73b2ba39abd0ec24a747ebf6a0a7.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The heart of our build system is an expansive (and expanding) library of build pieces integrated with a meticulously designed snap-to system. We've distilled the genre\u2019s best ideas, removed countless pain points, and developed a powerful and intuitive building system that maximizes freedom and minimizes frustration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap Smart, Not Rigid: </strong>Anchor points give you Lego-style speed without restricting creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-Level Efficiency: </strong>Common frustrations like micro-alignment and gap-hunting vanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable Detail: </strong>Block out a whole district quickly, then refine details to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/f4445c9b8858815a53d754b95ffe4af1.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/f4445c9b8858815a53d754b95ffe4af1.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/f4445c9b8858815a53d754b95ffe4af1.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/a045981327f2f0a18f40d31c8c8a4d1d.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3730540839d28cbdd366924a8ffe2d3a.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3730540839d28cbdd366924a8ffe2d3a.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3730540839d28cbdd366924a8ffe2d3a.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaparks offers a variety of game modes to suit every player\u2014whether you're here to build, compete, create content, or simply relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/e5256cf0d6ad58a6db2d34573b5cba52.avif?t=1750436025\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaverse Mode:</strong> Opens the gates to a connected, multiplayer world where park admission, avatar rewards, live events, and player-driven shops bring your creations to life\u2014and possibly to profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode: </strong>Players and creators define their own rules. Set constraints, time limits, or unique build conditions, inviting others to participate. This mode thrives on community creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode: </strong>Provides total freedom with unlimited resources and creative control\u2014perfect for experimenting or vibing with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career (RPG): </strong>Offers a guided path through curated stories, structured tutorials, and unique unlocks\u2014ideal for players who love progression and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3769768a37ad5d046d0edb197744f842.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes: </strong>Career (RPG), Sandbox, and Simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Innovative Modular Building System: </strong>Design and manage architecture, scenery, attractions, shops, services, and interactive experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resorts / Hotels: </strong>Customisable suite rooms lobby-spawn points for Live Guests and NPC\u2019s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Fashion and Avatar Customisation: </strong>Metahuman Avatars, Outfits, Wearables, and theme-exclusive merch to craft truly signature looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Ticketing &amp; Admission (ParkManagement): </strong>VIP passes, and season-ticket systems for granular control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Themes: </strong>Every theme is underpinned by detailed world-building, unique characters and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midway &amp; Redemption Games: </strong>Build Midways and Arcades, and Redemption Games.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/6c3bf89898cff979f4b3a517b684677a.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/6c3bf89898cff979f4b3a517b684677a.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/6c3bf89898cff979f4b3a517b684677a.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pin Trading: </strong>Collect, and trade limited-edition pins directly with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar Services: </strong>Restrooms, First Aid, Guest Services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recreational Activities</strong>: Laser Tag, Drone Racing, Mini Golf, Obbies &amp; Playgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles &amp; Dynamic Content: </strong>Explore parks to find unique items and complete collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Travel: </strong>Transport Ride Stations serve as fast travel points for Live Guests, or they can simply enjoy the ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boutique Stores: </strong>Shops for Hairstyles, Facepaint, and other odds and ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Avatar Roles: </strong>Yes Step in as ride operator, mechanic, groundskeeper, tour guide, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soda Station: </strong>Fill your souvenir cups with concoctions to discover unique and interesting effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Events: </strong>Modular Showspaces to perform, play, and party with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusions and Effects: </strong>Make some magic using real-world practical effects employed by park designers, including lighting, sound, pyro, projectors, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Architecture, Scenery, Props, and Attractions: </strong>Intuitive and powerful tools that enable immersive storytelling through environmental components, animatronics, props, and effects.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/66ac3c6185a0701b117aca55083ad8bc.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to add Metaparks to your wishlist now! For upcoming updates check out our Discord!\u00a0You're joining us at the very beginning of our journey, and we\u2019re dedicated to maintaining a transparent, community-driven development process.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/819d297f2e7bc9f86d1750c25cad48f9.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/819d297f2e7bc9f86d1750c25cad48f9.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/819d297f2e7bc9f86d1750c25cad48f9.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d0f3e6210df74e5baa5d58507577a6d7.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d0f3e6210df74e5baa5d58507577a6d7.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d0f3e6210df74e5baa5d58507577a6d7.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/c67aead20f3093a84f644b92c1d5f132.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaparks is a highly immersive and unique theme park simulator where players design, share, and explore the theme parks of their dreams. Combining the expansive nature of MMOs with the open-ended creativity of sandbox games, Metaparks allows players to design intricate attractions, architecture, and scenery with a powerful, intuitive modular building system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simulation layer challenges players to manage resources, balance guest satisfaction, and compete within a thriving economy. With user-generated content (UGC) at its core, players can create, share, and explore their unique creations in a vibrant, community-driven experience.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/8f83142773c87d3bc7dda23cf1b2214f.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/8f83142773c87d3bc7dda23cf1b2214f.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/8f83142773c87d3bc7dda23cf1b2214f.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme parks are defined by the worlds they create\u2014their power lies in the stories they tell. In Metaparks, every in-game theme is rooted in a richly developed universe, complete with original IPs, immersive lore, character backstories, and cross-media storytelling. From environmental design to NPC interactions, every element contributes to a living, breathing world built for exploration and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/287e99943034b7fc743958009e417dd4.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d3733423583277962c59778a0d0fc789.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d3733423583277962c59778a0d0fc789.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/d3733423583277962c59778a0d0fc789.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've drawn inspiration from iconic creators in the themed entertainment world. Metaparks is grounded in the principles of real-world ride systems, physically-based materials, special effects, and park design\u2014reimagined for players. By simplifying complexity without sacrificing depth, we offer the components and knowledge to build impressively realistic parks in a playful, intuitive way. From pre-made schematics to modular systems teaching through practice, we empower players to think like designers\u2014while still having fun like guests <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/b0103ef51af6960582afea7616f18a01.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/225c22d62df3bd0cd91ed3f526d4f811.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/225c22d62df3bd0cd91ed3f526d4f811.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/225c22d62df3bd0cd91ed3f526d4f811.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Metaparks is launching with a range of captivating biomes and imaginative themes, each combining to create truly unique park experiences.\u00a0Every biome influences gameplay uniquely\u2014shaping weather patterns, foliage, lighting, and available attractions, and wardrobe items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/06d5faf7b282566539c1f2721ece7694.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/06d5faf7b282566539c1f2721ece7694.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/06d5faf7b282566539c1f2721ece7694.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/b3ecc40164f045bb003b67c870b21f0c.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/7e5851c15e6a5658d4465e4fd35b7a79.avif?t=1750436025\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Metaparks, every creator has the opportunity to establish a Virtual Brand\u2014a personal or shared identity spanning parks, players, and playstyles. Your Virtual Brand grows with you, expanding to new locations, sharing profits, and attracting contributors who add value to your vision. Whether you're working solo or collaborating with friends, your Virtual Brand unlocks new ways to grow, delegate tasks, and scale across the Metaparks universe. <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/30d4a3ef7667af396d56efa376bfd015.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/963c73b2ba39abd0ec24a747ebf6a0a7.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/963c73b2ba39abd0ec24a747ebf6a0a7.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/963c73b2ba39abd0ec24a747ebf6a0a7.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The heart of our build system is an expansive (and expanding) library of build pieces integrated with a meticulously designed snap-to system. We've distilled the genre\u2019s best ideas, removed countless pain points, and developed a powerful and intuitive building system that maximizes freedom and minimizes frustration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap Smart, Not Rigid: </strong>Anchor points give you Lego-style speed without restricting creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-Level Efficiency: </strong>Common frustrations like micro-alignment and gap-hunting vanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable Detail: </strong>Block out a whole district quickly, then refine details to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/f4445c9b8858815a53d754b95ffe4af1.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/f4445c9b8858815a53d754b95ffe4af1.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/f4445c9b8858815a53d754b95ffe4af1.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/a045981327f2f0a18f40d31c8c8a4d1d.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3730540839d28cbdd366924a8ffe2d3a.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3730540839d28cbdd366924a8ffe2d3a.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3730540839d28cbdd366924a8ffe2d3a.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaparks offers a variety of game modes to suit every player\u2014whether you're here to build, compete, create content, or simply relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/e5256cf0d6ad58a6db2d34573b5cba52.avif?t=1750436025\" data-has-big width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaverse Mode:</strong> Opens the gates to a connected, multiplayer world where park admission, avatar rewards, live events, and player-driven shops bring your creations to life\u2014and possibly to profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode: </strong>Players and creators define their own rules. Set constraints, time limits, or unique build conditions, inviting others to participate. This mode thrives on community creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode: </strong>Provides total freedom with unlimited resources and creative control\u2014perfect for experimenting or vibing with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career (RPG): </strong>Offers a guided path through curated stories, structured tutorials, and unique unlocks\u2014ideal for players who love progression and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/3769768a37ad5d046d0edb197744f842.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes: </strong>Career (RPG), Sandbox, and Simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Innovative Modular Building System: </strong>Design and manage architecture, scenery, attractions, shops, services, and interactive experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resorts / Hotels: </strong>Customisable suite rooms lobby-spawn points for Live Guests and NPC\u2019s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Fashion and Avatar Customisation: </strong>Metahuman Avatars, Outfits, Wearables, and theme-exclusive merch to craft truly signature looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Ticketing &amp; Admission (ParkManagement): </strong>VIP passes, and season-ticket systems for granular control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Themes: </strong>Every theme is underpinned by detailed world-building, unique characters and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midway &amp; Redemption Games: </strong>Build Midways and Arcades, and Redemption Games.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/6c3bf89898cff979f4b3a517b684677a.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/6c3bf89898cff979f4b3a517b684677a.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/6c3bf89898cff979f4b3a517b684677a.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pin Trading: </strong>Collect, and trade limited-edition pins directly with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar Services: </strong>Restrooms, First Aid, Guest Services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recreational Activities</strong>: Laser Tag, Drone Racing, Mini Golf, Obbies &amp; Playgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles &amp; Dynamic Content: </strong>Explore parks to find unique items and complete collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Travel: </strong>Transport Ride Stations serve as fast travel points for Live Guests, or they can simply enjoy the ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boutique Stores: </strong>Shops for Hairstyles, Facepaint, and other odds and ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Avatar Roles: </strong>Yes Step in as ride operator, mechanic, groundskeeper, tour guide, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soda Station: </strong>Fill your souvenir cups with concoctions to discover unique and interesting effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Events: </strong>Modular Showspaces to perform, play, and party with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusions and Effects: </strong>Make some magic using real-world practical effects employed by park designers, including lighting, sound, pyro, projectors, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Architecture, Scenery, Props, and Attractions: </strong>Intuitive and powerful tools that enable immersive storytelling through environmental components, animatronics, props, and effects.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/66ac3c6185a0701b117aca55083ad8bc.avif?t=1750436025\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to add Metaparks to your wishlist now! For upcoming updates check out our Discord!\u00a0You're joining us at the very beginning of our journey, and we\u2019re dedicated to maintaining a transparent, community-driven development process.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/819d297f2e7bc9f86d1750c25cad48f9.poster.avif?t=1750436025\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/819d297f2e7bc9f86d1750c25cad48f9.webm?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359020/extras/819d297f2e7bc9f86d1750c25cad48f9.mp4?t=1750436025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Metaparks is a massive multiplayer role-playing game in which you can create and experience the ultimate virtual theme park universe. Either immerse yourself in a rich lore and story driven narrative or join up with your friends to shape your own unique memories.",
